    "text": "Continue the agreed plan: entry 7 of 8 in the story lorebook — the Guild Ledger, which owns Quill and prices her freedom.\nlorebook entry\nWrite \"The Guild Ledger\" into \"The Hoard of the Unflown — Lore\"\nLorebook\nEntry title\nKeywords\nContent\nAlways in context\nCreate it\nCreates this in SillyTavern. Nothing existing is changed.\nReject",
